n the US population</article-title><source>J Am Diet Assoc</source><year>1999</year><volume>99</volume><issue>2</issue><fpage>166</fpage><lpage>74</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9972183</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CIT0006"><label>6</label><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Stender</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Dyerberg</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>H&#x000f8;lmer</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Ovesen</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name></person-group><year>1994</year></citation></ref><ref id="CIT0007"><label>7</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Leth</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Bysted</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Hansen</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Ovesen</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>						<italic>Trans</italic> fat content in Danish margarines and shortenings marketed in Denmark</article-title><source>JAOCS</source><year>1998</year><volume>75</volume><fpage>1079</fpage><lpage>83</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="CIT0008"><label>8</label><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Fagt</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Trolle</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name></person-group><source>Forsyning af f&#x000f8;devarer 1955&#x02013;1999</source><year>2001</year><comment>Udvikling i danskernes kost-forbrug, indk&#x000f8;b og vaner. National Food Agency of Denmark, S&#x000f8;borg (in Danish)</comment></citation></ref><ref id="CIT0009"><label>9</label><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Stender</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Dyerberg</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name>